      <p><strong>Inteligência Artificial &amp; LLMs:</strong> OpenAI (GPT-4/4o), Google Gemini, Vertex AI, LangChain, LangGraph, Google ADK, MCP (Model Context Protocol), IA Agêntica, Sistemas Multi-Agente, Prompt Engineering, Avaliação de LLMs (LLM-as-Judge), IA Generativa, RAG, GraphRAG, Hybrid Search, Grafos de Conhecimento, Bancos Vetoriais (Weaviate, Pinecone, pgvector, Qdrant), Embeddings, Fine-tuning (LoRA/QLoRA), DPO, Function Calling, Tool Use, Structured Outputs, Guardrails, AI Safety, IA Conversacional, NLP, Compound AI Systems, Sistemas de Recomendação.</p>
      <p><strong>Cloud &amp; Infraestrutura:</strong> Google Cloud (GCP, Vertex AI, Cloud Storage, Cloud Run, BigQuery, Pub/Sub), AWS (Lambda, S3, Glue, Redshift, DynamoDB, API Gateway, ECS), Firebase, Supabase, Cloud Architecture, Serverless, CI/CD (GitHub Actions, Cloud Build, Terraform, Docker)</p>
      <p><strong>Backend &amp; Dados:</strong> Python, TypeScript, Golang, FastAPI, Pydantic, RESTful APIs, GraphQL, Kafka, WebSockets, Event-driven Architecture, Microservices, Neo4j, Cypher, PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB, Redis, Elasticsearch, Airbyte, Airflow, Databricks, Playwright, Analytics Dashboards</p>
